TITLE='Authentic title "The 3 \'Silent\' Fees Destroying Your Wealth (Not Taxes)" is a hidden-cost list with a negation hook. The script names three costs (investment fees, inflation and cash drag, the behaviour gap); only the first is a literal fee, and the third is presented twice. The promise is delivered, with metaphorical "fees".'
